@Trippie_HostAddress = http://localhost:5024

### Health check
GET {{Trippie_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 404 — domain NotFoundException
GET {{Trippie_HostAddress}}/dev/throw/notfound
X-Correlation-Id: probe-notfound

### 400 — ValidationException with per-field errors
GET {{Trippie_HostAddress}}/dev/throw/validation
X-Correlation-Id: probe-validation

### 409 — ConflictException with custom error code
GET {{Trippie_HostAddress}}/dev/throw/conflict
X-Correlation-Id: probe-conflict

### 401 — UnauthorizedException
GET {{Trippie_HostAddress}}/dev/throw/unauthorized
X-Correlation-Id: probe-unauthorized

### 403 — ForbiddenException
GET {{Trippie_HostAddress}}/dev/throw/forbidden
X-Correlation-Id: probe-forbidden

### 500 — unhandled InvalidOperationException (fallback mapper)
GET {{Trippie_HostAddress}}/dev/throw/internal
X-Correlation-Id: probe-internal

###
